WEBVTT

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:09.820
This way, everyone!

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:10.890
Please hurry!

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:13.980
This is not war.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.640
It's a rout.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.550
Beasts who reject King 
Arthur's infinite mercy

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:21.310
and dare to oppose us,

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:23.910
at least you can enter Nirvana in an instant

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:26.620
through Ganapati's generosity!

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.090
Chandra Cannon, fire!

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:41.130
<i>Chandra Gupta's Giant War Armor 
from the Star of the West</i>

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:46.040
<i>has begun to unleash its superior 
firepower to invade Takeda's lands.</i>

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:56.390
<i>Only the sorrow of the powerless 
people has been left in its wake.</i>

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:59.300
<i>Adjusting ley line reactor by 0.4.</i>

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.330
<i>Visibility is high near planned landing site.</i>

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:03.390
<i>Company 8, t-minus 8 minutes until drop.</i>

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:05.470
<i>All men on combat standby.</i>

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:05.470
Nobu...

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:07.630
Ichihime-sama!

00:02:58.380 --> 00:02:59.220
This is...

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.620
Takeda's banner.

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:04.390
Ichihime-sama...

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:07.270
Ichihime-sama!

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:08.680
Ichihi—

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:16.930
It can't be!

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:22.130
What child's play.

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:24.560
It seems assuming control 
of the Pillars of Hercules

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:27.370
will pose no trouble at all.

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:34.080
Now that one looks like a worthy foe.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:39.150
But given its spindly build...

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:44.650
Battles are not won through size alone.

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:46.150
What?

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:54.400
How did you—

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.780
You will never reach enlightenment.

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:58.920
But, at the very least, I can offer you...

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:02.900
Expiation.

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:25.280
What is that?

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.870
A murderous intent that 
threatens to overwhelm everything...

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:45.380
How intoxicating...

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:53.810
What?!

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:55.460
Lord Kenshin has fallen?!

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.300
Yes, my lord!

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:57.620
Takeda's castle is lost.

00:04:57.620 --> 00:05:00.360
Their lands are in ruins.
There is utter devastation.

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:02.700
Ichi...

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:07.080
How could the mighty Lord 
Kenshin have been defeated?

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:09.450
Who're we up against?

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:14.810
I can only think of one man who 
could have defeated Uesugi Kenshin.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:20.080
A man who is capable of 
conquering entire continents...

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:24.120
The avatar of destruction 
and dominion, Alexander,

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:26.820
and the embodiment of his ferocious spirit,

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:29.630
the Giant War Armor, Gaia.

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:45.570
What power!

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:50.020
Submit to me.

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:53.580
I am not here to end lives.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:58.590
Will you use that strength 
to serve King Arthur?

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:00.350
Submit?

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:02.360
Inconceivable.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.590
If I submit to you,

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:08.630
I can no longer fight you.

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.470
The terror that grips one's heart...

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:15.130
That holds a blade to one's throat!

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:17.750
I had all but forgotten it!

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:21.120
This is what I consider 
an ideal battle to be.

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:24.650
For that reason, I can never submit!

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.920
As long as we are locked 
in a battle to the death,

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:32.650
it cannot end until one of us 
has spent his life force!

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:35.690
Clashing with an overwhelming power,

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:38.920
exerting oneself to the utmost, 
then to finally perish! The joy of it!

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.320
The sheer bliss!

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:44.870
A warrior as mighty as you must understand!

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:49.870
Unfortunately, I cannot.

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:51.010
What?

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:59.380
I have never experienced the 
fear of death in battle,

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:01.740
for I have yet to meet a foe against whom

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:04.240
I would need to exert myself to the utmost.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:06.160
That is most unfortunate.

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:12.540
Once again, I have yet to find 
the limits of my power.

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:15.400
Then I swear an oath to you

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:21.880
that I will allow you to savor 
the joy of a true battle.

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:25.810
You're a strange one.

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:32.910
I will remember your name,

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:35.490
Uesugi Kenshin.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:43.430
Do not forget to fulfill your oath.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:46.410
Indeed. I will not.

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:54.230
You'll take up the
 brush before war begins?

00:07:54.230 --> 00:07:55.620
Apparently you have 
some time on your hands.

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:59.570
I am not in a position to take up the sword.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:03.270
Even should someone hold a blade against me,

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:05.840
I would still continue my own research.

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:08.950
Your words show quite the commitment.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:11.270
What's this?

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:15.000
Perhaps it can be called... 
the order of the universe.

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:16.960
It's good work.

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:17.860
Oh?

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:20.940
You'd call unfinished work "good"?

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:24.480
If you can't judge something 
with an uncertain future,

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:27.920
that means you can't take the 
measure of a man who still lives.

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:30.730
Some things are clear
 only when the future is not.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:32.090
That may be true...

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:34.500
But oftentimes, an unclear future

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:36.940
only creates greater uncertainty,

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:38.980
just as in you right now.

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:45.550
You are more talkative today 
than usual, after all.

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:47.360
You're a shrewd man.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:50.190
If doubt has taken root in your heart

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:53.330
now that Sir Mitsuhide is gone, take a card.

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:57.290
Knowing yourself may 
clear your uncertainty.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:05.770
I see...

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:07.700
The Emperor.

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:11.780
The doubt that now fills your mind...

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.470
...stems from overwhelming 
authority and power.

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:20.420
Alexander of the West is indeed 
capable of becoming an emperor.

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:21.710
I know.

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:24.800
A man capable of defeating Lord Kenshin

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:27.800
should not be underestimated, no doubt.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:31.010
After all, without King Arthur,

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:37.560
Alexander would have conquered the
 Star of the West and become its king.

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:39.980
Even so, I will not retreat.

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:43.860
Facing him is an unavoidable battle 
if I am to rule heaven and earth,

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.980
no matter what sacrifices will be made.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:49.420
I see.

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:59.430
I must report to Nobu right away

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:03.030
that he must never engage 
Alexander in battle.

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:06.420
That man is a demon that 
will devour heaven and earth...

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:13.720
Monkey, is that you?

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:16.080
You knew I was here?

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:18.250
You just have a loud presence.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:19.720
So mean.

00:10:19.990 --> 00:10:20.990
You smell, too.

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:22.930
That was uncalled for!

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:25.590
What do you want?

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:28.280
It's not like you.

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:28.960
What?

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:31.970
The leader should just look 
forward without hesitation.

00:10:31.970 --> 00:10:34.910
His men merely follow him.

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.970
I think that's what Mitsu would say.

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:41.810
Letting doubts creep in because

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:43.900
you've lost one man just isn't like you.

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:44.950
If you feel uncertain,

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:47.740
I'll just work enough for two,
 or even three men.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:50.380
Is that not good enough?

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:54.250
Hah, you talk big for a monkey.

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:57.800
I see.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.820
One may be an emperor,
 too, in this way.

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:06.600
<i>The Star of the West has
 summoned the Pillars of Hercules</i>

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:08.700
<i>seized control of Yomotsuhirasaka,</i>

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:12.250
<i>and now seeks to use that as a base for 
conquering the entire Star of the East.</i>

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:17.350
<i>But the West had an ulterior motive...</i>

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:21.480
The lands where dragons 
dance have great power!

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:31.880
When five points are linked,

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:35.420
the great Holy Grail will appear among us.

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:45.030
What is going on?

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:46.940
What?

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:51.280
The dragon of this star...

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:54.040
This is...

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.000
I see.

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:07.390
{Eyecatch}

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:07.390
There they are!

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:08.290
Ichihime-sama!

00:12:08.690 --> 00:12:10.290
Don't let them escape! After them!

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:16.430
Crap...

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:21.590
Don't worry, Ichihime-sama.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:24.450
We will take you to 
Nobunaga-sama without fail.

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:27.400
We will protect you,
 even if it costs our lives.

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:28.810
Everyone...

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:51.830
Mitsuhide?

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:53.240
Mitsuhide!

00:12:54.780 --> 00:12:56.050
Ichihime-sama.

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:59.320
I am glad you have safely returned.

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:03.220
I would endure any disgrace 
to return to your side,

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.360
if it would allow me to protect you.

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:06.930
Mitsuhide...

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:08.880
I'm so glad.

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:13.990
And what of Caesar-dono?

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:16.990
Was he not with you?

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:22.070
Are you worried about Caesar-dono?

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:25.000
He is not an evil man.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:32.150
He has remained on the Star of the West,

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:34.780
saying there was something he had to do.

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:37.780
I see...

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.110
There is nothing to concern yourself about.

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:43.940
He is a shrewd man.

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:45.790
I am certain he has a plan.

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:50.960
Th-That's...

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:55.400
Alexander!

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:11.820
That is, without a doubt, the...

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:12.710
Don't say it.

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:18.000
I've never felt such 
oppressive force before.

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:21.650
He's mine.

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:23.230
Here I come!

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:25.890
Azuchi preparing to enter combat-mode.

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:27.060
Deploying stabilizers.

00:14:27.390 --> 00:14:29.060
The Fool, activated.

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:30.700
Standing by in launch shelter.

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:50.690
The dragon of the East.

00:14:56.820 --> 00:14:57.870
Don't, Nobu!

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:00.200
You must not fight Alexander!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:04.840
He is completely ignoring me.

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:06.440
The arrogance.

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:11.340
I am not sure it is wise to let 
him face Alexander by himself.

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:12.900
I'll go, too!

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:13.730
Wait!

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:18.210
Nobunaga wants to have a duel 
with the commanding general.

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:18.710
But...

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:20.700
I have faith in him!

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:41.970
<i>I</i> am afraid?

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:44.640
Impossible!

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:46.900
What's the matter? You won't attack me?

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:51.650
Then I will, Destroyer-King.

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:57.250
The weaker its bite, the louder its bark.

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:58.620
No, Nobu!

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:04.760
What?!

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:08.760
He intercepted Nobu's
 sword just using his fingertips!

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:20.010
You're all show and no substance.

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:21.840
You're just like a child.

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:25.280
Silence!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:29.890
Let it resound like thunder!

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:35.220
How absurd!

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:44.690
How about this, then?

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:49.240
In raiding and plundering, be like fire!

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:50.870
Futile!

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:01.750
How tiresome.

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:03.590
No!

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:06.540
That power would lay waste 
to the entire region!

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.480
My betrothed!

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:08.660
You must fall back!

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:15.900
You are not even worthy 
of being the opening act.

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:17.260
Retreat, Nobu!

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:18.170
Nobu!

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:20.900
Mitsu! Ichi! Why?!

00:17:22.990 --> 00:17:27.270
A worthless man like you, the Destroyer-King?

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:30.540
I pity Uesugi Kenshin.

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:33.920
Gaia is absorbing the ley 
lines from the ground itself.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:37.200
Unless it's stopped, the planet could die!

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.290
I'm going out.

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:39.480
I have to protect everyone!

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:40.560
Hey, wait!

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:46.090
Monkey, lend me your Regalia.

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:49.540
Give this to Nobu-sama.

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:51.230
Understood.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.480
Not yet.

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:57.860
I still don't have enough.

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:01.240
Himiko, lend me your Regalia, as well.

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:02.480
You must not!

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:05.870
Activating four Regalia at once 
will be too heavy of a burden!

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.460
<i>Just give it to me.</i>

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:11.090
<i>If we do nothing, this whole 
region will be blown into pieces!</i>

00:18:13.020 --> 00:18:14.360
There's no other choice.

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:22.140
I am Oda Nobunaga.

00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:24.300
Regalia of earth,

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:28.550
give me strength through our bond!

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:30.010
Nobu!

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.520
The Regalia won't activate...

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:34.810
What is going on?!

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:40.400
It can't be...

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:45.010
Is the Regalia trying to devour 
my betrothed's very life?

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:51.200
How pathetic.

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:55.460
Regalia that surpasses its wielder's capacity

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:59.530
will destroy their mind and body.

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:05.610
You will drown in power, and die!

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:13.150
No, Nobunaga!

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:35.060
The dragons in the earth are going berserk!

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:38.310
If we don't stop them,
 this land... this star... will die!

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:39.540
Nobu-sama!

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:05.330
Rejoice, for you are worthy of 
having your life ended by me,

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:06.500
Destroyer-King!

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:08.500
I will not let you kill Nobunaga!

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:17.950
Jeanne-chan, take Nobu-sama and run!

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:19.720
I will hold him here!

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:20.950
Hideyoshi!

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:26.460
Bastard!

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:29.360
Surely you can sense the 
difference in our power.

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:31.190
Why struggle so?

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:34.400
Duh! It's because Nobu-sama's here!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:39.500
Nobu-sama is capable of ruling 
over heaven and earth!

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:42.270
He won't lose to a low-life like you!

00:20:46.310 --> 00:20:51.080
Even now, you still choose to bluster?

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:02.460
Monkey.

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:04.930
Hideyoshi?

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:10.480
It is an honor to be dealt 
death by mine hand.

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:11.830
Savor it well.

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:30.090
Hideyoshi!

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:35.600
Monkey...

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:47.710
Ranmaru, retreat.

00:21:47.710 --> 00:21:50.150
Monkey will forfeit his life if we don't.

00:21:53.490 --> 00:21:57.910
In honor of the idiot who chose to 
risk his life on his faith in you,

00:21:57.910 --> 00:21:59.790
I will let you live this time.

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:03.100
I will not forget this humiliation.

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:08.210
Hideyoshi!

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:13.170
Oh, no.

00:22:13.170 --> 00:22:17.090
The rampage is causing 
the ley lines to run amok!

00:22:17.800 --> 00:22:19.710
This place is lost.

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:34.860
The Destroyer-King...

00:24:11.580 --> 00:24:14.320
The pitiless wheel continues 
to turn without end.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:16.010
Its shaft has been broken,

00:24:16.010 --> 00:24:18.920
and we wander, lost without an axle.

00:24:19.510 --> 00:24:21.830
Next time: The Wheel of Fortune.

00:24:22.590 --> 00:24:25.260
Who will answer the dragon's question?
